    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et pour tout cela, nous faisons une ferme alliance, et nous l'écrivons. Et à l'apposition des sceaux",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "[se trouvèrent] nos princes, nos lévites, [et] nos sacrificateurs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et à la tête de ceux qui apposèrent leur sceau furent : Néhémie, le Thirshatha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", fils de Hacalia, et Sédécias.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "– Seraïa, Azaria, Jérémie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pashkhur, Amaria, Malkija,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hattush, Shebania, Malluc,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harim, Merémoth, Abdias,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daniel, Guinnethon, Baruc,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshullam, Abija, Mijamin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maazia, Bilgaï, Shemahia : c'étaient là les sacrificateurs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "– Et les lévites : Jéshua, fils d'Azania ; Binnuï, des fils de Hénadad ; Kadmiel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "et leurs frères, Shebania, Hodija, Kelita, Pelaïa, Hanan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Michée, Rehob, Hashabia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaccur, Shérébia, Shebania,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hodija, Bani, Beninu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "– Les chefs du peuple : Parhosh, Pakhath-Moab, Élam, Zatthu, Bani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bunni, Azgad, Bébaï,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adonija, Bigvaï, Adin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ater, Ézéchias, Azzur,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hodija, Hashum, Bétsaï,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hariph, Anathoth, Nébaï,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magpiash, Meshullam, Hézir,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshézabeël, Tsadok, Jaddua,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelatia, Hanan, Anaïa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osée, Hanania, Hashub,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hallokhesh, Pilkha, Shobek,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehum, Hashabna, Maascéïa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "et Akhija, Hanan, Anan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malluc, Harim, Baana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et le reste du peuple, les sacrificateurs, les lévites, les portiers, les chantres, les Nethiniens, et tous ceux qui s'étaient séparés des peuples des pays [pour s'attacher] à la loi de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", leurs femmes, leurs fils et leurs filles, tous ceux qui avaient de la connaissance [et] de l'intelligence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "se joignirent à leurs frères, les principaux d'entre eux, et s'engagèrent par",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "exécration et par serment de marcher selon la loi de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qui avait été donnée par Moïse, serviteur de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", et d'observer et de pratiquer tous les commandements de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", notre Seigneur, et ses ordonnances et ses statuts,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "et [promettant] que nous ne donnerions pas nos filles aux peuples du pays, et que nous ne prendrions pas leurs filles pour nos fils ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "et que, si les peuples du pays apportaient des marchandises ou toutes sortes de grains, le jour du sabbat, pour les vendre, nous n'en prendrions pas le [jour du] sabbat, ni en un jour saint ; et que nous laisserions [la terre en friche] la septième année, et remettrions toute espèce de dettes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et nous nous sommes établi des commandements, nous imposant le tiers d'un sicle par an pour le service de la maison de notre",
